  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SHO campaign for Ukraine</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">On February 24th the conflict in Ukraine escalated. In just 2 months thousands have been killed and injured and over 7,7 million people are displaced. Almost 6 million refugees have left Ukraine and the number is still growing. With a state of emergency declared and men between the ages of 18 and 60 having to stay to fight, many displaced women and children are left alone. The damage of houses, schools, hospitals and other services and infrastructure is extensive. Direct aid is needed for people who are hit by the events in Ukraine and for the refugees in neighbouring countries. There is a need for shelter, medical and psychosocial care, food and clean drinking water.</narrative>
  </description>
